{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/bloom-arjaan-by-rotana-bloom-holding-al-saadiyat-island","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":690,"crm_id":"604","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"ready","title":"Bloom Arjaan By Rotana","slug":"bloom-arjaan-by-rotana-bloom-holding-al-saadiyat-island","display_address":"Al Saadiyat island","building_type":["apartment","studio"],"completion_year":"2024","developer":"Bloom Holding","price":951000,"display_price":"951K","lattitude":24.5228263,"longitude":54.4305573,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":2,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>The Bloom Arjaan by Rotana project is part of the prestigious Park View complex on the picturesque Saadiyat Island in Abu Dhabi. Located opposite New York University Abu Dhabi, which makes it very attractive to university staff, international students and visiting lecturers.</p><p>Bloom Arjaan by Rotana features 217 serviced<strong> </strong>apartments, ranging from cozy studios to spacious <strong>one and two bedroom apartments.</strong></p><p>The apartments are spacious, bright due to large windows, comfortably furnished, have a modern and stylish design, have a comfortable and spacious living room and a fully equipped kitchenette.</p><p>A special feature of the project is an infinity pool at a height of 30 meters above the ground.</p><p>The complex also offers a large selection of amenities: cafes and restaurants, various shops, a fitness center, areas for walking, recreation and entertainment. Tamara Polyclinics LLC is within walking distance. Saadiyat Beach and Soul Beach, Saadiyat Beach Golf Club, Cranleigh Abu Dhabi School and Al-Hamd Mosque are all 5-10 minutes' drive away.</p><p>The favorable location and excellent characteristics of the residences make them attractive to tenants, offering potential rental income to investors.</p>","tile_image":null,"